@startuml SD09_OfflineReplay
!include _style.iuml
title SD-09  Replay saved frames offline (UC-17) — REQ-41, REQ-42

actor Imager
participant ":ReplayCommand" as Cmd
participant ":SettingsStore" as Store
participant ":MonitorServiceBuilder" as B
participant ":ReplayImageSource" as Src
participant ":ReplayClock" as Clk
participant ":MonitoringCycle" as Cyc
participant ":MetricsCsvWriter" as Csv

Imager -> Cmd : NINAAllskySafetyMonitor.Harness replay --frames <folder> --settings <trial.json>
Cmd -> Store : Load(trial.json)
Store --> Cmd : MonitorSettings (trial thresholds)
Cmd -> B : Build(settings, ports = {ReplayImageSource, ReplayClock,\nFixedMountStateSource, ConfigSiteLocationSource, ConsoleLogSink})
B --> Cmd : cycle
loop each saved frame (in capture order)
  Cmd -> Src : advance()
  Src -> Clk : UtcNow = frame capture time
  Cmd -> Cyc : RunOnceAsync()
  Cyc -> Src : FetchAsync()
  Src --> Cyc : SkyImage(frame)
  Cyc --> Cmd : MonitorSnapshot
  Cmd -> Csv : Append(snapshot)
end
Cmd --> Imager : results.csv (opens in Excel)
note over Cmd : No rig and no running NINA needed.\nCompare results.csv against the tuning\nrecording to evaluate threshold changes.
@enduml
